<title>UK: Korea Exchange Bank sets $100 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Korea Exchange Bank sets $100 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Chase Manhattan International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KOREA EXCHANGE BANK</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    20.MAR.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     22.5 BP   PAY DATE    20.MAR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY BAA1	ISS PRICE  99.945    FULL FEES   UNDISC</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/KR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  KOREA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
